@prefix : <http://example.org/agora/world/simulation#> .
@prefix intention: <http://example.org/agora/intention#> .
@prefix schema: <https://schema.org/> .
@prefix ssn: <http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/> .
@prefix desire: <http://example.org/agora/desire#> .
@prefix review: <http://example.org/agora/review#> .
@prefix sensing: <http://example.org/agora/sensing#> .
@prefix water: <http://example.org/agora/water#> .
@prefix reporting: <http://example.org/agora/reporting#> .
@prefix ag: <http://example.org/agora#> .
@prefix market: <http://example.org/agora/market#> .

#  Tomato's agent's PRIVATE beliefs. See genesis/beliefs-fern.ttl for what each term means.

##  sensing:Subscribing
#   The anxious one, deliberately: its fast end sits ON the constitutional floor, so after any
#   scare the release staircase (#139) has the longest climb in the world — 10, 15, 22, 33, 49,
#   73, 109, 163, 244, 366, 549, 600 — and `cadence_acked_s` draws the whole geometry where the
#   other agents show only a few treads. A demo belief, and a legal one: how closely to watch
#   when frightened is exactly the kind of thing agents are allowed to differ on.
:tomato_agent
    sensing:fastSleepS 10 ;
    sensing:slowSleepS 600 ;
    sensing:readingGraceS 45 ;
    sensing:alarmDeltaFraction 0.25 .  # the jolt threshold — a revisable first pick, like fern's

##  market:Bidding
:tomato_agent
    market:hasEndowment 100.0 ;
    water:litresPerFraction 2.0 ;
    water:maxValuePerL 0.80 .

##  How often it says how it is — belief base size, reading freshness, silent write failures.
#   Omit this line and the agent reports nothing; see agora/metrics.py.
:tomato_agent reporting:metricsIntervalS 60 .

##  Self-review — how often at the very least.
#   Required because the world gave this agent room to move (review:commits, in world.ttl): an
#   agent granted none derives no review capability and needs no interval. A FLOOR and not a
#   schedule — a decision plans its own next arising from when its effect could show.
#   See knowledge/decisions/self-review-is-a-capability.md.
:tomato_agent review:reviewIntervalS 300 .

##  desire — the pick inside the region
#   The point this agent steers its moisture toward. PRIVATE where the region is public: the
#   region is deduced from what the plant states and answers to the sovereign; the aim answers
#   to the region (desire:AimShape) and to nobody else, which is what makes it this agent's.
#   It used to be water:hasTarget — one number that was also the market's pricing input. The
#   market now asks desire for it, so an agent in a world with no market could still hold one.
:tomato_agent desire:aims [ ssn:forProperty water:SoilMoisture ; schema:value 0.50 ] .

##  intention — the commitment policy
#   How long a standing commitment absorbs a second impulse to do the same thing before a new
#   adoption may supersede it. The ledger records what this agent does either way; the patience
#   is what makes "already doing something about it" a fact with teeth. Two minutes: several
#   auction rounds, and far past any one bid window.
:tomato_agent intention:patienceS 120 .
